.TH CHMAP_SIZE 3 "2026-10-31" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Macros"
.SH NAME
chmap_size \- get the number of entries in a hash map (type-inferred wrapper)
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <ccollections/chashmap.h>

chmap_size(chm);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
Type-inferred wrapper for chashmap_elem_count(). It takes the same arguments
and gives the same result; chashmap_elem_count(3) has the full contract.
.fi
.SH PARAMETERS
.nf
chm    Hash map to query
.fi
.SH RETURN VALUE
.nf
The number of entries in the map.
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR chashmap_elem_count (3)
